faqs:
  - q: Do you work with our auditors?
    a: Yes. We ship control evidence continuously and work directly with your external auditor during fieldwork. SOC 2, PCI, and model risk attestations are the common scope.
  - q: Can you support CCAR or DFAST timelines?
    a: Yes. We have run the data lineage and reporting pipelines that feed those submissions. Calendar work is a serious part of the engagement.
  - q: How do you handle model risk management?
    a: Model inventory, documentation, pre-deployment validation, and periodic review. The audit trail is part of the platform, not a separate binder.
  - q: What about the cloud approval from our risk team?
    a: Common. We work inside the guardrails your risk team already approved. If no cloud is approved yet, we help with the approval process and cloud design.
  - q: Do you place fractional risk or data leaders?
    a: Yes. Fractional Head of Data and fractional risk leads are common placements. See /staffing/fractional-leadership/.
